  "source": "reference_project_pair",
  "scope": "Existing Visu OnAction, OffAction, OnText, OffText, Text and Description string parameters, grouped by room, function type, icon and description role.",
  "notes": [
    "Mappings were extracted by matching stable channel-view IDs in the reference pair; project IDs and names are not stored.",
    "Icon mappings use exact original parameter texts. Field-level room rules take precedence; other unknown text is preserved until reviewed.",
    "Unchanged observations are counted separately and are not translation suggestions.",
    "More than one candidate means the reference is inconsistent; the field is not automatically selected.",
    "Lighting OffAction had two untranslated observations. The reference power-supply OnText had seven Uključeno and one contradictory Isključeno; the configured translation is corrected to Uključeno.",
    "Only parameters that exist in the loaded project are edited. XML attributes, including defaultValue and label, are not translated.",
    "Trigger Text and NumericFloatStatus Description translations were confirmed in the reference pair. Description groups keep Button, Average, Sensor, Sensor (VOC) and Sensor (CO2) separate within each room.",
    "NumericFloatStatus Description containing srednja (case-insensitive), or equal to Average (case-insensitive), becomes Srednja plus the current applied room name. Room numbers and WC capitalization are preserved; an unresolved room gives plain Srednja. The rule examines Description, not the object name or number of functions.",
    "The room rule can normalize mixed Average and Srednja descriptions in the same room. Other mixed groups remain unselected for review. Automatic descriptions follow room-name changes; manual description edits and unchecked changes are preserved."
  ],
